WEBVTT

00:00:07.860 --> 00:00:09.570
Hagiwara? Give up?!

00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:17.490
Hagiwara! Are you okay?!

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:19.370
I'm going to stop this match!

00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:20.660
Hagiwara?

00:00:20.870 --> 00:00:22.330
Hagiwara!

00:00:22.540 --> 00:00:24.000
Sakura-<i>sempai</i>!

00:00:24.210 --> 00:00:26.420
No...!

00:00:29.460 --> 00:00:31.960
<i>If only I could be more entranced</i>

00:00:32.170 --> 00:00:35.130
<i>Chasing my dream every day</i>

00:00:35.340 --> 00:00:43.770
<i>Ah, I could be proud with my flowing tears</i>

00:00:51.780 --> 00:00:57.030
<i>The feelings after frustration</i>

00:00:57.240 --> 00:01:02.540
<i>Are beyond my every choice</i>

00:01:02.740 --> 00:01:08.170
<i>Resolve myself to not accept losing</i>

00:01:08.380 --> 00:01:13.210
<i>Then stand up onto a new stage</i>

00:01:13.420 --> 00:01:18.760
<i>White, glistening sweat is beautiful</i>

00:01:18.970 --> 00:01:24.140
<i>I decided I'll live my life</i>

00:01:24.350 --> 00:01:27.020
<i>No matter how many times I fall</i>

00:01:27.230 --> 00:01:33.690
<i>If I stand up the same,</i>
<i>it will lead me to tomorrow</i>

00:01:33.900 --> 00:01:36.400
<i>With a strong feeling to not lose</i>

00:01:36.610 --> 00:01:39.610
<i>Say goodbye to the previous me</i>

00:01:39.820 --> 00:01:44.700
<i>A different me from yesterday is being born</i>

00:01:44.910 --> 00:01:47.540
<i>If only I could be more entranced</i>

00:01:47.750 --> 00:01:50.630
<i>Chasing my dream every day</i>

00:01:50.830 --> 00:01:58.130
<i>Ah, I could be proud with my flowing tears</i>

00:01:59.550 --> 00:02:03.090
Hagiwara's in big trouble!
She's not moving at all!

00:01:59.840 --> 00:02:05.310
Episode 12: To the World!

00:02:03.300 --> 00:02:05.140
Is this the end?!

00:02:05.350 --> 00:02:07.180
Wake up! Hagiwara!

00:02:07.390 --> 00:02:09.350
Do a comeback!

00:02:10.310 --> 00:02:12.390
Sakura-<i>chan</i>...!

00:02:21.570 --> 00:02:24.780
Sakura! It isn't over yet!

00:02:35.460 --> 00:02:37.540
What an escape!

00:02:37.750 --> 00:02:42.420
Hagiwara forced herself
out of Miyazawa's Spider Hold!

00:02:49.770 --> 00:02:51.020
One...!

00:02:51.220 --> 00:02:52.640
Two...!

00:02:53.850 --> 00:02:57.020
Sakura can still fight?!

00:03:15.210 --> 00:03:17.290
Wow! She got her up high!

00:03:17.500 --> 00:03:18.920
Sakura-<i>sempai</i>!

00:03:31.720 --> 00:03:34.480
Wh-What a rally of moves!

00:03:34.680 --> 00:03:37.480
Their actions unfold with sheer intensity!

00:03:37.690 --> 00:03:39.770
Hagiwara Sakura! Miyazawa Elena!

00:03:39.980 --> 00:03:44.110
It's as if the ring is now their stage!

00:03:44.530 --> 00:03:50.620
Top idols on the ring are
fighting in the name of pride.

00:03:50.830 --> 00:03:54.910
This is real drama, real excitement...

00:03:55.120 --> 00:03:58.460
Yes, real entertainment!

00:03:58.670 --> 00:04:02.380
Juri, was this all part of your plan?

00:04:02.590 --> 00:04:04.010
Of course not.

00:04:04.840 --> 00:04:07.180
This is their potential.

00:04:28.240 --> 00:04:30.780
Sakura... You're strong!

00:04:30.990 --> 00:04:35.160
And now I know why you're so strong!

00:04:52.890 --> 00:04:54.930
Not wanting to lose...

00:04:55.140 --> 00:04:58.520
I can sense your strong desire to win!

00:04:58.730 --> 00:05:02.690
That desire is the source of your strength!

00:05:22.250 --> 00:05:23.790
But, Sakura...

00:05:27.590 --> 00:05:30.510
I can't lose either.

00:05:30.720 --> 00:05:33.680
I want to beat you!

00:05:44.690 --> 00:05:48.820
Hagiwara attacked,
sacrificing her body and knees

00:05:49.030 --> 00:05:51.400
to deflect Miyazawa's moonsault press!

00:05:51.610 --> 00:05:53.740
What determination!

00:06:02.870 --> 00:06:04.170
One...!

00:06:04.380 --> 00:06:05.790
Two...!

00:06:17.310 --> 00:06:19.810
Hagiwara pulls off
Kazama Rio's special move,

00:06:20.020 --> 00:06:21.730
the Northern Light Bomb!

00:06:21.940 --> 00:06:23.690
Nicely done...!

00:06:27.730 --> 00:06:29.110
One...!

00:06:29.320 --> 00:06:30.740
Two...!

00:06:47.960 --> 00:06:52.510
Sa-ku-ra! Sa-ku-ra! Sa-ku-ra!

00:06:53.800 --> 00:06:57.890
E-le-na! E-le-na! E-le-na!

00:06:58.100 --> 00:07:00.310
- E-le-na!
- What in the world?

00:07:00.520 --> 00:07:03.600
This is just like a Sweet Diva concert...

00:07:07.770 --> 00:07:10.320
Elena, you're...

00:07:11.530 --> 00:07:14.860
Good... Very good!

00:07:18.330 --> 00:07:20.040
Hagiwara...!

00:07:33.550 --> 00:07:36.970
Hagiwara's stance! Could it be...?!

00:07:46.020 --> 00:07:47.770
It's the Sakura Special!

00:07:47.980 --> 00:07:49.310
She didn't backflip!

00:07:49.520 --> 00:07:51.860
She must've worn out her knee!

00:07:58.570 --> 00:08:01.530
Wait! Is she going to...?!

00:08:22.430 --> 00:08:23.680
One...!

00:08:23.890 --> 00:08:25.560
- Two...!
- Two...!

00:08:25.770 --> 00:08:27.600
- Three!
- Three!

00:08:29.100 --> 00:08:30.060
She did it!

00:08:30.270 --> 00:08:33.150
Hagiwara Sakura has finally done it!

00:08:33.360 --> 00:08:36.650
A triple spin body press
from her Sakura Special!

00:08:36.860 --> 00:08:38.990
Her mesmerizing move of grace

00:08:39.200 --> 00:08:43.160
has taken the win from Miyazawa Elena!

00:08:59.550 --> 00:09:02.970
Well, now I can
finally take a breather here.

00:09:03.180 --> 00:09:04.140
But...

00:09:04.350 --> 00:09:05.810
Hm?

00:09:06.020 --> 00:09:08.690
Was this a good result?

00:09:17.690 --> 00:09:19.200
Sakura...

00:09:23.200 --> 00:09:26.660
I guess I lost...

00:09:36.550 --> 00:09:37.960
Elena-<i>chan</i>?

00:09:55.690 --> 00:09:57.110
Elena...

00:09:58.650 --> 00:10:01.740
I can't take this...!

00:10:02.740 --> 00:10:04.450
They can call me a coward!

00:10:04.660 --> 00:10:06.740
They can call me a cheater!

00:10:06.950 --> 00:10:08.580
I...

00:10:08.790 --> 00:10:11.460
don't want to lose you!

00:10:12.330 --> 00:10:13.960
Please, Sakura!

00:10:14.170 --> 00:10:16.960
Please come back!

00:10:17.170 --> 00:10:18.550
Elena...

00:10:18.760 --> 00:10:22.130
I'm the real me when I'm with you, Sakura.

00:10:22.340 --> 00:10:24.720
Challenging you on equal grounds...

00:10:24.930 --> 00:10:29.850
Working together to make Sweet
Diva the world's best idol group...

00:10:30.060 --> 00:10:31.890
That's my dream!

00:10:33.100 --> 00:10:36.690
I need you...!

00:10:41.030 --> 00:10:43.490
That's the same for us too!

00:10:43.700 --> 00:10:47.330
Our feelings are the same as Elena-<i>chan</i>!

00:10:50.040 --> 00:10:52.410
Huh? What? What?!

00:10:52.620 --> 00:10:54.540
Sakura-<i>chan</i>...!

00:10:54.750 --> 00:10:57.630
Come back to Sweet Diva!

00:10:57.840 --> 00:11:02.220
Sa-ku-ra! Sa-ku-ra! Sa-ku-ra!

00:11:23.150 --> 00:11:27.240
Those are the main
members of Sweet Diva!

00:11:27.450 --> 00:11:31.120
What in the world is going to happen?!

00:11:31.330 --> 00:11:33.160
Those girls...

00:11:33.960 --> 00:11:38.590
Elena, we also want Sakura to come back...

00:11:38.790 --> 00:11:41.380
And it's the same with the fans too!

00:11:41.590 --> 00:11:45.680
That's why we called
for everyone to come here!

00:11:45.880 --> 00:11:47.720
Everyone...

00:11:47.930 --> 00:11:49.760
Please, Sakura-<i>chan...</i>

00:11:50.560 --> 00:11:53.180
Please return to Sweet Diva!

00:11:53.390 --> 00:11:56.440
Please return as Sweet Diva's Sakura-<i>chan</i>!

00:11:58.690 --> 00:11:59.810
That's right!

00:12:00.020 --> 00:12:02.610
We've all been waiting for you too!

00:12:02.820 --> 00:12:06.700
Sakura-<i>chan</i>, come back to Sweet Diva!

00:12:08.320 --> 00:12:10.830
Well, I...

00:12:11.030 --> 00:12:13.290
Hagiwara, don't leave!

00:12:13.490 --> 00:12:15.500
You pulled off an awesome match!

00:12:15.710 --> 00:12:18.460
You're already a star wrestler!

00:12:18.670 --> 00:12:20.540
Sakura...!

00:12:20.750 --> 00:12:22.250
Sakura-<i>sempai</i>!

00:12:22.460 --> 00:12:24.760
Don't quit pro wrestling!

00:12:24.960 --> 00:12:27.010
You still have a lot to see!

00:12:27.220 --> 00:12:28.220
Sakura!

00:12:28.430 --> 00:12:31.970
We haven't even settled things between us!

00:12:40.190 --> 00:12:42.270
Chairman! What should we do?!

00:12:42.480 --> 00:12:45.150
Which side should we be on?!

00:12:45.360 --> 00:12:50.370
I'm going to go with
what Sakura-<i>chan</i> decides!

00:13:11.970 --> 00:13:16.310
Wh-What?! It's Jackall Tojo!

00:13:16.520 --> 00:13:20.690
The world champion,
Jackall Tojo, has appeared!

00:13:21.850 --> 00:13:27.030
All the chaos and noise here has silenced!

00:13:37.000 --> 00:13:39.080
That was a great match back there.

00:13:39.290 --> 00:13:44.130
Japan's girls' pro
wrestling has come quite far.

00:13:44.340 --> 00:13:45.750
I've decided.

00:13:47.470 --> 00:13:49.800
Sakura! Come to Shangri-La!

00:13:50.010 --> 00:13:52.640
Your next stage is the world!

00:13:52.850 --> 00:13:54.220
What?!

00:13:54.430 --> 00:13:55.970
Shangri-La...?

00:13:56.180 --> 00:13:58.430
The world circuit, Shangri-La?

00:13:58.640 --> 00:13:59.770
That's right!

00:13:59.980 --> 00:14:04.190
Hagiwara's being invited
by the champ to see the world!

00:14:04.400 --> 00:14:08.320
Whoa! That's a seal of her
being world class material!

00:14:08.530 --> 00:14:10.200
The hell are you saying?!

00:14:10.400 --> 00:14:13.490
Sakura-<i>chan</i> is gonna return to Sweet Diva!

00:14:13.700 --> 00:14:16.290
She's done enough wrestling already!

00:14:19.500 --> 00:14:21.120
I... I also...

00:14:21.330 --> 00:14:27.170
I also want to challenge the
world as a professional wrestler.

00:14:27.380 --> 00:14:28.550
But...

00:14:28.760 --> 00:14:30.170
But?

00:14:31.380 --> 00:14:34.550
I can't break my ties with Sweet Diva.

00:14:34.760 --> 00:14:38.310
I can't leave my friends and fans behind!

00:14:39.520 --> 00:14:40.940
Sakura...

00:14:45.860 --> 00:14:48.320
There are just too
many things on my mind...

00:14:48.530 --> 00:14:51.490
I don't even know what I want to do!

00:14:51.700 --> 00:14:54.030
What's there to think about?

00:14:54.240 --> 00:14:57.700
Your path is already decided.

00:15:00.080 --> 00:15:02.370
Do both of them!

00:15:02.580 --> 00:15:03.250
Huh?!

00:15:03.460 --> 00:15:05.960
B-Both?!

00:15:08.420 --> 00:15:10.170
Being an idol and a wrestler;

00:15:10.380 --> 00:15:13.090
you're going to do both of them.

00:15:13.300 --> 00:15:17.720
Giving it all you've got to
inspire everyone is the same,

00:15:17.930 --> 00:15:20.350
whether you're an idol or a wrestler.

00:15:20.560 --> 00:15:24.190
You should already know that, Sakura.

00:15:36.070 --> 00:15:39.370
The answer was in front of you

00:15:39.580 --> 00:15:43.000
ever since the day you got on the ring!

00:15:43.210 --> 00:15:46.830
But, am I really able to handle being both

00:15:47.040 --> 00:15:49.670
an idol and a wrestler?

00:15:49.880 --> 00:15:51.960
It's not whether you can do it or not.

00:15:52.170 --> 00:15:54.300
You just have to!

00:15:55.090 --> 00:15:57.390
If you can't discard one over the other,

00:15:57.600 --> 00:16:00.350
then you shouldn't discard either of them.

00:16:00.560 --> 00:16:04.690
Whether you can handle both is up to you!

00:16:04.890 --> 00:16:08.730
You can't make a call
before giving it a shot!

00:16:10.230 --> 00:16:13.150
Make up your mind, Sakura!

00:16:13.360 --> 00:16:15.950
Aren't you going to
be the best in the world?

00:16:17.280 --> 00:16:18.660
You said it!

00:16:18.870 --> 00:16:20.580
You can do it, Sakura-<i>chan</i>!

00:16:20.780 --> 00:16:26.370
You can be the best in the
world as an idol and a wrestler!

00:16:26.580 --> 00:16:29.250
Sa-ku-ra! Sa-ku-ra!

00:16:29.460 --> 00:16:33.920
- Sa-ku-ra! Sa-ku-ra! Sa-ku-ra!
- Sa-ku-ra! Sa-ku-ra! Sa-ku-ra!

00:16:57.320 --> 00:16:58.740
I...

00:17:00.160 --> 00:17:01.580
Sakura...

00:17:02.410 --> 00:17:04.500
I'll support you too.

00:17:04.700 --> 00:17:07.040
You can do this!

00:17:07.250 --> 00:17:08.460
Elena...

00:17:08.670 --> 00:17:10.670
You too, Elena.

00:17:12.840 --> 00:17:14.920
It's not only Hagiwara Sakura.

00:17:15.130 --> 00:17:16.800
You're going to do this too.

00:17:17.010 --> 00:17:19.590
You're going to be an idol and a wrestler.

00:17:19.800 --> 00:17:20.970
Juri-<i>san</i>?!

00:17:21.180 --> 00:17:25.310
That's right. You're
going to join Shangri-La too,

00:17:25.520 --> 00:17:27.180
Miyazawa Elena.

00:17:27.390 --> 00:17:28.940
You're still a rough cut, but

00:17:29.140 --> 00:17:33.940
you have the potential
to shine atop the world too!

00:17:34.150 --> 00:17:36.530
B-But...

00:17:36.740 --> 00:17:38.530
I just...

00:17:38.740 --> 00:17:42.700
...went on the ring to get Sakura back.

00:17:42.910 --> 00:17:46.580
The loser has to
retire from wrestling too...

00:17:46.790 --> 00:17:50.040
Elena... Don't lie to yourself.

00:17:50.250 --> 00:17:52.000
Lie...?

00:17:52.210 --> 00:17:54.880
You already know through the match

00:17:55.090 --> 00:17:56.920
that you don't want to lose.

00:17:57.130 --> 00:17:59.550
You want to win and get stronger.

00:17:59.760 --> 00:18:02.890
You want to continue pro wrestling.

00:18:25.240 --> 00:18:28.250
You're already a pro wrestler.

00:18:28.450 --> 00:18:30.660
That's right! Miyazawa!

00:18:30.870 --> 00:18:33.040
Don't quit pro wrestling!

00:18:33.250 --> 00:18:36.880
I wanna see more of your matches!

00:18:37.090 --> 00:18:41.470
E-le-na! E-le-na! E-le-na!

00:18:42.630 --> 00:18:46.310
Do you hear the audience's voice?

00:18:46.510 --> 00:18:49.640
Be honest to yourself already.

00:18:57.730 --> 00:19:00.610
Now then, the audience is waiting.

00:19:01.400 --> 00:19:04.070
They're waiting for your answer!

00:19:04.280 --> 00:19:06.830
Isn't that right, everyone?!

00:19:08.580 --> 00:19:11.080
That's right! Let's hear it!

00:19:11.290 --> 00:19:14.170
What are you both gonna do?!

00:19:24.260 --> 00:19:26.090
An idol and a pro wrestler...

00:19:26.300 --> 00:19:30.600
We can't choose one over the other.

00:19:31.770 --> 00:19:35.730
Both are very dear to us!

00:19:35.940 --> 00:19:38.650
We'll do our very best.

00:19:38.860 --> 00:19:41.530
As an idol and as a wrestler,
we'll do double...

00:19:41.740 --> 00:19:44.780
No, even more than before!

00:19:44.990 --> 00:19:48.620
To be the best entertainers in the world...

00:19:50.240 --> 00:19:51.660
- We're...
- ...we're...

00:19:53.620 --> 00:19:56.500
- ...gonna be the strongest in the world!
- ...gonna be the strongest in the world!

00:20:10.430 --> 00:20:12.770
Misaki? Kanae?

00:20:19.230 --> 00:20:21.360
We can't be losing to them.

00:20:21.570 --> 00:20:24.990
Right. We won't stop challenging either!

00:20:25.780 --> 00:20:28.780
Now, it's time for the idols to shine!

00:20:28.990 --> 00:20:29.830
Huh?!

00:20:30.030 --> 00:20:31.740
Jackall-<i>san</i>?!

00:20:33.830 --> 00:20:35.080
Those are...!

00:20:35.290 --> 00:20:38.290
Don't keep the fans waiting!

00:20:39.880 --> 00:20:41.300
- Yes!
- Yes!

00:20:48.590 --> 00:20:51.220
<i>Three, Two, One, and here we go!</i>
<i>Let's shoot for the greatest stage</i>

00:20:51.430 --> 00:20:53.970
<i>Dancing & singing, let's liven things up!</i>

00:20:54.180 --> 00:20:58.810
<i>Together it's a brand new day,</i>
<i>c'mon everyone's cheers are</i>

00:20:59.020 --> 00:21:01.690
<i>Fan! Fanfare!!!</i>

00:21:05.940 --> 00:21:11.200
<i>Dreams are our heart's sun</i>

00:21:11.410 --> 00:21:16.830
<i>Let's make them real with our magic</i>

00:21:17.040 --> 00:21:22.290
<i>Fashion, makeup, but inside's a passion</i>

00:21:22.500 --> 00:21:26.380
<i>to a bright future</i>

00:21:26.590 --> 00:21:27.510
<i>Step up!!</i>

00:21:27.720 --> 00:21:30.180
<i>The spotlight shines</i>

00:21:30.390 --> 00:21:32.850
<i>Microphone stand, fluttering skirts</i>

00:21:33.060 --> 00:21:40.230
<i>The heart's rhythm, swing</i>
<i>swing, notes dance, it's show time!!</i>

00:21:40.440 --> 00:21:46.360
<i>Watch me be No. 1 someday, your No. 1</i>

00:21:46.570 --> 00:21:47.570
<i>Let's sing (All day long)</i>

00:21:47.780 --> 00:21:49.200
<i>Let's dance (All night long)</i>

00:21:49.400 --> 00:21:57.290
<i>With all my love,</i>
<i>more than being first, your smile</i>

00:21:57.500 --> 00:21:58.910
<i>is what I want to see (Hold me tight)</i>

00:21:59.120 --> 00:22:02.880
<i>Let's make true my dream</i>

00:22:03.090 --> 00:22:04.130
<i>Anytime, do my best</i>

00:22:04.340 --> 00:22:05.670
<i>Do your best and don't give up</i>

00:22:05.880 --> 00:22:08.170
<i>Dancing & singing, as yourself</i>

00:22:08.380 --> 00:22:09.630
<i>If you like it, it's all fine</i>

00:22:09.840 --> 00:22:13.220
<i>The beat in your heart is your answer</i>

00:22:13.430 --> 00:22:16.060
<i>Fan! Fanfare!!!</i>

00:22:21.600 --> 00:22:26.440
Sakura-<i>sempai</i> as Sweet Diva is cool too!

00:22:26.780 --> 00:22:30.780
- Few months later -

00:22:31.410 --> 00:22:32.820
- Yay!
- Yay!

00:22:34.910 --> 00:22:37.240
How long until the arena, Elena?!

00:22:37.450 --> 00:22:39.960
Ten minutes by running,
five minutes going full throttle!

00:22:40.160 --> 00:22:42.870
I'll get there in four
minutes then! I'll race you!

00:22:43.080 --> 00:22:46.750
You're on! Don't blame
me if you lose your breath!

00:22:46.960 --> 00:22:48.670
I'm not that wimpy anymore!

00:22:48.880 --> 00:22:50.300
I know!

00:22:50.800 --> 00:22:53.260
Don't get hurt you two!

00:22:53.470 --> 00:22:55.720
You still have a concert after the match!

00:22:55.930 --> 00:22:57.350
- Yes!
- Yes!

00:23:03.440 --> 00:23:05.690
- Let's get the match started!
- Let's get the match started!
